# Solarized (light) is BUILT IN to bat, so no theme file or `bat cache --build` step is needed.
#
# If a future bat drops it, the symptom is silent: bat falls back to its default theme
# rather than erroring. Check with `bat --list-themes | grep -i solarized`.
--theme="Solarized (light)"
--style="numbers,changes,header"
--paging=auto
--italic-text=always
